<< /A 42 0 R /Alt (Diagram illustrating an evidence-aware framework for N6-methyladenosine \(m6A\) regulation of immune-cell inflammatory fate, featuring sequential steps: inflammatory inputs, m6A machinery, RNA-fate change, immune-cell state, and tissue outcome, influenced by context modifiers. Below, evidence appraisal categories\204mechanistically resolved, functional/intermediate, and associative/emerging\204are described, with a key principle emphasizing the importance of regulator-target-reader-cell-stage combinations.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 28 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
